   "key": "func ReportBaselineNights.before(_:archive:sleepSchedule:)",
   "hash": "0fe21a3f9819bab8",
   "does": "Overnight index entries dated strictly before the night, newest first, decoded lightweight (entries that fail to decode are skipped), until they hold count (BaselineTracker.recoveryWindowNights, 60) baseline nights: distinct nightKeys before the reported night's with a session BaselineTracker.isBaselineCandidate admits. The daily loop selects its baseline from these with the score's rule, so it can reach the same 60 nights. Shared by the Send-Report menu and Reports → Browse.",
   "entry": null,
   "calls": [
    "Emuqu/Sources/Storage/Archive+StoreForwarding.swift::var SessionArchive.entries",
    "Emuqu/Sources/Storage/Archive.swift::func SessionArchive.retrieveLightweightOrLog(_:caller:)",
